## Test Commands
```bash
make test                    # Run all tests
pytest tests/api/           # Run API tests only
pytest tests/features/      # Run BDD tests (feature files)
pytest -m unit              # Run unit tests
pytest --cov                # With coverage
pytest -v                   # Verbose - shows scenario names
```

